{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879448910, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 56, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879448655,47288722,1351]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66981983]小孟孟孟孟[/uid] (2026-08-24 13:28):[/b]<br/><br/>就非要吸干散户才罢手[/quote]<br/>这有什么办法  存量市场<br/>散户就是最弱势群体。弱势群体就会被收割。", "lou": 460, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 879448655, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787549449}, {"pid": 879448992, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 49, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879448878,47288722,1352]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66994021]-我爱切尔西-[/uid] (2026-08-24 13:30):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大 下半年做的国算越跌越买吗？[/quote]<br/>怎么可能 肯定是根据指数趋势做高抛低吸。", "lou": 461, "content_length": 43, "reply_to": 879448878, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787549492}, {"pid": 879449208, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 55, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879448922,47288722,1352]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67273091]泰山派二师兄[/uid] (2026-08-24 13:30):[/b]<br/><br/>明天来个大跌不就全完了[s:ac:瞎][/quote]<br/>现在就是看怎么出量 出量市场才能活 不管是向上还是向下<br/>没量的市场就没波动。不管进攻还是防御都是一潭死水", "lou": 462, "content_length": 103, "reply_to": 879448922, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787549613}, {"pid": 879451059, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 57, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879450861,47288722,1357]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62771233]极地丶之光[/uid] (2026-08-24 13:48):[/b]<br/><br/>是不是可以这样理解，场内资金持筹太多的话自己的剩余资金是拉不起来的，把筹码分给新资金，自己多了现金新资金也有了筹码，这样更容易往上拉，现在往下砸的过程就是分筹码的过程？[/quote]<br/>存量资金的博弈啊  就好像我上一波接近4000卖的  现在要想买回来有更多的差价 不就是逼上一次3992没卖的那些资金割肉吗", "lou": 463, "content_length": 111, "reply_to": 879450861, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787550641}, {"pid": 879452811, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 93, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879452210,47288722,1360]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67252787]什马东东[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:00):[/b]<br/><br/>散户是越来越聪明了，够队是越来越不好割了，机构是越来越割不到了，散户不割肉，这票怎么涨？这股市还怎么办？<br/>没有增量资金，存量的散户不动，到底谁是血包？[/quote]<br/>散户跟聪明没关系<br/>现在应该是割不动了  但是如果有反弹 3900会割肉 然后4000追回来。", "lou": 464, "content_length": 79, "reply_to": 879452210, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787551589}, {"pid": 879453446, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 173, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "刚才你们说拉回去一点就卖的要说话算话啊  卖了大盘就能放量了", "lou": 465, "content_length": 56, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787551919}, {"pid": 879453711, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879453534,47288722,1362]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=43045557]找不到从良的理由[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:12):[/b]<br/><br/>为什么散户要割肉，如果3800是国家队的底，现在都这么低了还要割肉吗？7月的都还没回来割什么肉[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>第一波跌下去大家都能抗<br/>但是反弹一波后  再次下跌就不一定能抗了。", "lou": 466, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 879453534, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787552037}, {"pid": 879454434, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 73, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879453808,47288722,1364]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67265639]柚子asd[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:14):[/b]<br/><br/>真的在卖了，量取出来了[/quote]<br/>我看到什么我就说什么  我看盘看的是资金的动向和背后的情绪，不是那种死板的点数", "lou": 467, "content_length": 79, "reply_to": 879453808, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787552421}, {"pid": 879454843, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 104, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879453952,47288722,1364]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60916468]灰兔尾[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:16):[/b]<br/><br/>我不觉得这里靠跌破3864才放出的量是什么好事情<br/><br/>我觉得这里杀出来的不是恐慌盘，是技术多头的止损盘，靠卖血换来的钱，对身体有好处吗？[/quote]<br/>这里还管什么身体<br/>宏观上这里没有重新走牛预期 那现在就是存量博弈<br/>做到极致就能收割别人。<br/>至于大盘 也不用担心<br/>指数问题不大 上面会保证大家有牛市这个信心支持<br/>你总不能说现在这个指数点位不是牛市吧。", "lou": 468, "content_length": 187, "reply_to": 879453952, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787552630}, {"pid": 879455310, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879454484,47288722,1366]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64973700]SpamSender[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:20):[/b]<br/><br/>这地方还有足够仓位割肉的技术派也是很菜的技术派了[/quote]<br/>技术派这里倒真不会割肉<br/>但是不懂技术的散户会<br/>因为刚才那里是情绪节点。", "lou": 469, "content_length": 71, "reply_to": 879454484, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787552859}, {"pid": 879455872, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 106, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们都没割 就在那乱说<br/>今天我本来预计是放2000E <br/>都2点半了  还是1500E<br/>量不够就很难上的。", "lou": 470, "content_length": 79, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787553156}, {"pid": 879456309, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:36", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879456183,47288722,1369]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=8963810]司空萌萌[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:35):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，量不够明后天都会继续杀吧？[/quote]<br/>杀是很难杀下去了  现在就是磨", "lou": 471, "content_length": 31, "reply_to": 879456183, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787553372}, {"pid": 879457494, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 139, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879456419,47288722,1370]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60327779]言肆cyn[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:37):[/b]<br/><br/>别说0轴了 V回均线我就卖 全卖 真的[/quote]<br/>做个标记", "lou": 472, "content_length": 13, "reply_to": 879456419, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787553989}, {"pid": 879458324, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 146, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "还是缩量 你们又耍我", "lou": 473, "content_length": 18, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787554405}, {"pid": 879458779, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 66, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879458590,47288722,1377]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67294017]灼眼的查理[/uid] (2026-08-24 14:55):[/b]<br/><br/>但是铁盒已经杀了4天，且放了两回量<br/><br/>再杀还要杀科技人吗，科技人血条有这么厚吗...[/quote]<br/>你把目光放到光存上<br/>你看看上周到今天 一来一回能割多少<br/>半导体已经很温柔了", "lou": 474, "content_length": 73, "reply_to": 879458590, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787554622}, {"pid": 879458929, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 98, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "如果怕死的 尾盘可以卖  相当于今天挣了1.5%  <br/>没错吧。", "lou": 475, "content_length": 46, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787554689}, {"pid": 879459465, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 15:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879459180,47288722,1378]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67219545]阿姆斯特凯旋[/uid] (2026-08-24 15:00):[/b]<br/><br/>别说了狼大，兆易这些内存已经再往7月低位头都不回的冲击了，大光也是<br/>但凡美股那边美光、海力士涨不动了分分钟滚回最初的起点了[/quote]<br/>除了基本面之外<br/>更多的是筹码集中度太高<br/>说的不是你们  是公墓<br/>你们可以在里面一键买一键卖  场外基金流出是一个过程 <br/>所以为什么我不愿意进海外链 特别是公墓持仓更多的海外链就是这样了  每次场内有主力拉到一个节点，场外公墓会被迫减出去，跟他们本身的想法没关系，他们需要给赎回的基民。", "lou": 476, "content_length": 265, "reply_to": 879459180, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787554954}, {"pid": 879459851, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 108, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 15:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879459338,47288722,1379]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67286043]六三一一[/uid] (2026-08-24 15:01):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大说做3个点的隔夜T，真就是3个点[/quote]<br/>如果尾盘T出去  也就是 避开了3个点的下跌还挣了1.5个点 <br/>如果做反的就是亏了这么多<br/>这是提前就算好的。<br/>等这波差价到8个点以上 那就可以拉上去了 ，这样哪怕散户再追回来 ，下次拉到8个-10个点的时候 这些散户不会走 ，因为刚回本或者差不多回本 甚至再恶心点，接近这个区间再做一次突破诱多。这样这些散户觉得反正都不亏了 而且准备要突破，还能继续加。<br/>又可以再来套一次。", "lou": 477, "content_length": 339, "reply_to": 879459338, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787555143}, {"pid": 879468501, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 62, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 16:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879466566,47288722,1384]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42823755]还是不是云[/uid] (2026-08-24 16:02):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，我想问下，这种思考机构的想法会不会太把机构单一化了，机构是多个机构组成的啊，他们能大多数都统一达成这种洗盘手法吗[/quote]<br/><br/>跟不上的就是被收割的 还有肯定跟不上被收割的公墓<br/>其实挣钱的也就不到机构总量的1/10", "lou": 478, "content_length": 83, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879466566, "postdatetimestamp": 1787559446}, {"pid": 879469818, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 76, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 16:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879468689,47288722,1384]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=15359256]&#39;不破楼兰终不还&#39;[/uid] (2026-08-24 16:18):[/b]<br/><br/>长期在年线下面还算牛市吗？[/quote]<br/><br/>没跌破3674就是牛市 连上一波高点都没破 谁敢说不是牛市？   ", "lou": 479, "content_length": 57, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879468689, "postdatetimestamp": 1787560047}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37097, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251595, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "kaleColourWgw", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251595, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "aut